  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{a}+\\mathrm{b}-\\mathrm{x})=\\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{x})$ then $\\int_a^b \\mathrm{xf}(\\mathrm{x}) \\mathrm{dx}$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "rAGbi",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{a+b}{2} \\int_a^b f(a+b-x) d x$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "c08mv",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{a+b}{2} \\int_a^b f(b-x) d x$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "iri8T",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{a+b}{2} \\int_a^b f(x) d x$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "38BfJ",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{b-a}{2} \\int_a^b f(x) d x$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$I=\\int_a^b x f(x) d x=\\int_a^b(a+b-x) f(a+b-x) d x$\n$=(a+b) \\int_a^b f(a+b-x) d x-\\int_a^b x f(a+b-x) d x$\n$=(a+b) \\int_a^b f(a+b-x) d x-\\int_a^b x f(x) d x$\n$2 I=(a+b) \\int_a^b f(x) d x$\n$I=\\frac{(a+b)}{2} \\int_a^b f(x) d x ; I=\\frac{(a+b)}{2} \\int_a^b f(a+b-x) d x$",
    "image": null
  },
